Third-party and interoperation
------------------------------

  * Beyond20 (GPL-3.0) is interoperated with through its documented interface and is never
    vendored.
  * Roll20 is a third-party service accessed as a logged-in user (RT credentials furnished,
    never harvested here). No D&D Beyond content is accessed or redistributed by this
    repository.
  * `data/` is gitignored and holds live credentials and derived local data. It is not part
    of the distribution.

Not covered by this licence (historical)
-----------------------------------------

While this repository still held the in-server tactics feature (removed in the v2.0.0 shrink,
#171 — see "Tactics live in the gem now" in CLAUDE.md), a local, gitignored
`data/tactics/monster-tactics-index.json` could hold roughly 190,000 words of verbatim prose
from Keith Ammann's "The Monsters Know What They're Doing", a commercial book — 149 unique
passages published under 280 alias keys. That was the author's text, not a summary of it. It
was never committed to this repository, was never covered by the MIT licence above, and was
never redistributable — nor was the 16 MB source PDF or the `build_index.py` that extracted
it, which sat beside it under the same gitignored `data/`.

The tactics feature — and with it, any local use of that text — moved to DM Whisper with the
#171 split. This repository's source no longer reads or produces any such index; `data/`
holds only live credentials and derived local data (see the bullet above).
